# An allow-list: nothing reaches the build context unless it is named here.
#
# The image needs the package and its metadata and nothing else. Written this
# way round because a checkout may hold the IEEE 1815.2 point tables under
# conformance/ (see conformance/README.md), which may not be redistributed,
# and an image is a thing people publish. A deny-list would have to keep up
# with every place such a file could be put; this cannot let one in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src
src/**/__pycache__
